a-Bradenton: the city series is the FHFA all-transactions index for North Port-Bradenton-Sarasota, FL (FHFA area code 35840), quarterly from 1985 Q1; the full history from the first published quarter is the long-history chart (1975-1984 values rest on thin samples). First-level areas: North Port-Bradenton-Sarasota, FL and the Florida state index. ZIP indices are annual, shown as flat quarters: each year's FHFA five-digit ZIP index value is repeated across its four quarters, so 12-month changes are year-over-year and quarterly changes within a year are zero. ZIP codes are Census ZCTAs placed in the metro by their county (39 ZIP codes with at least 5 years of index). Index levels are not comparable across areas: each series is rebased to 100 in the base period.","provisional_from":null,"rent":null,"shard_level":null,"tier":"B","unit_label":"","volume":null}